 "во внутренние промежутки ложится обязательно по одной Z": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 660 275\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">{2, 2}</text><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"127\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"136\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><rect x=\"166\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><rect x=\"198\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#2a2110\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" /><text x=\"213.0\" y=\"50\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Z</text><line x1=\"237\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><rect x=\"276\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"42\" fill=\"#93a1b1\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\">2 свободные Z на 3 промежутка</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"61\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">1 · 6 · 2 = 12</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"129\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">{2, 1, 1}</text><line x1=\"127\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"127\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"136\" y=\"108\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><rect x=\"166\" y=\"108\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#5ba8f5\" /><rect x=\"198\" y=\"108\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#2a2110\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" /><text x=